ou earn from those experiencing transformation in their health, the love Mother Nature showers upon you to protect &amp; nurture you, and the contentment you feel upon helping others move towards sustainability are the priceless gifts of the Supreme Father.</span></p></li></ol><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">When you share, we all win!</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> Let’s walk hand in hand to establish a perfect, happy &amp; disease-free world. The most significant contribution you can make is to follow the satvic lifestyle yourself to lead others by your own example first before you share :)</span></p><br><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Who should Join?</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">We serve a community of people who want to live a life of optimal health &amp; want to cure acute diseases simply by changing what they feed their minds, body &amp; soul. Our goal is to earn more blessings than money.&nbsp; Since you have known our true intentions &amp; our vision well, like-mindedness will be highly appreciated.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">We are actively seeking </span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">passionate people intending to selflessly serve mankind &amp; our Mother Nature who wish to support this venture genuinely </span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">and can help us extend our reach to more people who require our services and resources. This affiliate program is for you if your goals align with our venture.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Join us</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> if you are a lifestyle influencer, health coach, vegan influencer, satvic diet influencer, wellness blogger, mental health influncer or nutrition influencer with a purpose aligned towards helping others live a natural, healthy &amp; satvic lifestyle. It is a great opportunity for you if you are an eco-warrior, environment influencer, or a sustainability influencer with an aim to preserve nature, or a passionate kitchen garden influencer, plant influencer, home gardening blogger, or terrace gardening expert. If you don’t fit in any of the above categories but find your interests similar and can influence the masses, please feel free to join.</span></p><br><br></span></div></span></span>",
